#After forcked file file

AWS Grocery - Run Process

1. Start PowerShell with Admin access
2. Goto in the directory: C:\Users\.\AWS_grocery\backend
3. Turn on Virtual Environment: .\venv\Scripts\Activate.ps1
4. Run Command: python run.py
5. Goto the mentioned link:
	* Running on all addresses (0.0.0.0)
	* Running on http://127.0.0.1:5000
	* Running on http://192.168.1.151:5000
 6. Turn off Virtual Environment: deactivate
 